## 3.7 Cryptographic Blinding Framework (NEW SECTION)

**Design Principle**: All consensus-critical cryptographic operations must execute in a **blinded context** to prevent leakage via timing, power, EM, or fault analysis — without compromising determinism or consensus integrity.

### 3.7.1 Blinding Taxonomy

