- Disclosure key management spec (deferred)
- ZK membership proof soundness: `proofs/privacy/receipt_proof_soundness.v` (deferred)

TH-P1 and TH-P2 are normative targets. Coq proof skeletons are deferred to the
Domain B spec revision. The proof file paths above are reserved names.

