    if !verify_it_mac(&leaf_index, input, &it_mac_key) {
        return Err(DeriveError::ITMacVerificationFailed);
    }
    
    // Deterministic PoW check (see Layer 4)
    if !verify_pow_constraint(&leaf_index, input, epoch_chain) {
        return Err(DeriveError::PoWVerificationFailed);
    }
    
    Ok(leaf_index)
}
```

**Security Property**: 
```
P(collision) ≤ P(SHA3_collision) × P(BLAKE3_collision) × P(SM3_collision) × P(Streebog_collision)
           ≤ 2^-128 × 2^-128 × 2^-128 × 2^-128 = 2^-512
```
*Assuming independent primitives. Real-world correlation reduces this slightly, but remains far below feasible attack thresholds.*

