2. Multi-parameterization SHA3 blending (collision resistance beyond birthday bounds)
3. GF(2^128) polynomial IT-MAC in bytes 32-47 (unconditional security fallback)

This removes the decodable structure and makes the leaf index an irreversible commitment —
consistent with the assessment's note that `decode_leaf_index` should be removed.

